rades</strong> for all characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733160/extras/cb4553f11f85d69080feedd509d8e597.poster.avif?t=1782533036\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733160/extras/cb4553f11f85d69080feedd509d8e597.webm?t=1782533036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733160/extras/cb4553f11f85d69080feedd509d8e597.mp4?t=1782533036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733160/extras/0547d88220d0279b315eb67c6ca15d8c.avif?t=1782533036\" width=1220 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Rebecca</u>, the Explorer:</strong> Driven by revenge after losing her wife in the cataclysm. <i><strong>Melee-focused</strong></i> and relentless, her builds range from an <i>aggressive swordmaster</i> to an unyielding <i>tank</i>. She doesn't stop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Elias</u>, the Hunter:</strong> A wandering merchant who put his trade aside when the dungeon appeared. Part <i><strong>archer</strong></i>, part <strong><i>tactician</i></strong>, he came to help, and his <i>traps</i> and precision make him deadlier than he looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Aaron</u>, the Scholar:</strong> Abadiel's naïve young apprentice with an unshakeable sense of justice. Build him as an <i><strong>arcane spellcaster</strong></i> or a <i>complex combo-driven summoner</i>. His potential is still untested, even by him.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>Unlocka